          "title": "Tutorials",
          "excerpt": "Follow these focused walkthroughs to go from flash → motion → control. Each tutorial includes prerequisites, commands you can copy-paste, and expected results with screenshots. First Motion Flash firmware, home axes, and execute your first gesture. Start Live EMG Classification Stream 250 ms windows from Intan/Open Ephys and classify in...",
          "content": "\nFollow these focused walkthroughs to go from flash → motion → control.\nEach tutorial includes prerequisites, commands you can copy-paste, and expected results with screenshots.\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          \n            \n            \n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n            First Motion\n          \n\n          \n            \n              Flash firmware, home axes, and execute your first gesture.\n\n            \n          \n\n          \n            Start\n          \n        \n      \n    \n  \n    \n      \n        \n          \n            \n            \n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n            Live EMG Classification\n          \n\n          \n            \n              Stream 250 ms windows from Intan/Open Ephys and classify in real time.\n\n            \n          \n\n          \n            Open\n          \n        \n      \n    \n  \n    \n      \n        \n          \n            \n            \n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n            ROS2 Teleop\n          \n\n          \n            \n              Joystick control with collision checks using MoveIt.\n\n            \n          \n\n          \n            Coming soon\n          \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          \n            \n            \n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n            Force Plate Calibration\n          \n\n          \n            \n              Zero, span, and verify using reference weights.\n\n            \n          \n\n          \n            Coming soon\n          \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n",
